 README.md | 38 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 38 insertions(+)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 9161516..0ae59b4 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -154,3 +154,41 @@ rfnoc_image_builder -y ../icores/x410_X1_200_Aurora100Gbps_rfnoc_image_core.yml
 In this workflow, we launch `rfnoc_image_builder` once with `-I` on the current
 directory, and once without. In the latter case, the image builder will only
 use files that were installed into the right location.
+
+___________________________________________________________________________________________________
+
+This build is using uhd 4.9.0.1 and the isntructions to build this Aurora image for X310 are as follows:
+
+Build and install UHD from the modified source to get the updated BSP files:                                                                                                                                       
+  cd /home/yuriy/test/uhd/host                              
+  mkdir -p build && cd build  
+  cmake ..                                                                                                                                                                                                           
+  make -j8
+  sudo cmake --install .                                                                                                                                                                                             
+                                                            
+  This installs the three files that rfnoc_image_builder always reads from the system path:
+  - /usr/local/bin/rfnoc_image_builder (X310_AA target)                                                                                                                                                              
+  - /usr/local/share/uhd/rfnoc/core/io_signatures.yml (x3xx_sfpp_aurora type)                                                                                                                                        
+  - /usr/local/share/uhd/rfnoc/core/x310_bsp.yml (sfpp0/sfpp1 ports)                                                                                                                                                 
+                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
+  Build the bitfile                                                                                                                                                                                                  
+                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
+  cd /home/yuriy/test/rfnoc-oot-blocks                                                                                                                                                                               
+                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
+  /usr/local/bin/rfnoc_image_builder \                      
+    -y icores/x310_Aurora_rfnoc_image_core.yml \
+    -t X310_AA \                                                                                                                                                                                                     
+    -I . \
+    -F /home/yuriy/test/uhd/fpga \                                                                                                                                                                                   
+    -p /tools/Xilinx/Vivado \                               
+    -j 8
+                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
+  The -F flag is required because the FPGA RTL files (x300.v, Makefile, viv_generate_ip.tcl, etc.) are not installed by cmake --install — cmake reports them as "Up-to-date" even though they contain our changes.   
+                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
+  Output                                                                                                                                                                                                             
+                                                            
+  Bitfiles appear in build/ relative to the working directory:                                                                                                                                                       
+  - build/usrp_x310_fpga_Aurora.bit
+  - build/usrp_x310_fpga_Aurora.bin                                                                                                                                                                                  
+  - build/usrp_x310_fpga_Aurora.lvbitx                      
+  - build/usrp_x310_fpga_Aurora.rpt
